zRgCw","date":"2019-08-08T19:59:42","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9227437973022461,"text_excerpt":"Just discovered this new place. And it is wonderful! The staff is friendly and personable, the food was excellent and reasonably priced, And the music by Sharon Martin andClark Knighten was definitely in the groove. This will be my favorite Wednesday nite hangout. Loved the ambiance."},{"business_id":"fUUNiG5x6wP84ty5GoqtRw","review_id":"XSMEpQ2f-2Xl37CVTwk_DA","date":"2019-11-08T22:41:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.921998143196106,"text_excerpt":"Great happy hour! 2-7 with top shelf options. Food was great! And we parked right in front so make sure you check this out!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
